{"version":"phase6-batch5","texts":[
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_hanguang","title_original":"詩經・周南・漢廣","title_ja":"詩経 周南 漢広","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"南有喬木，不可休思。\n漢有遊女，不可求思。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_yueli","title_original":"詩經・召南・摽有梅","title_ja":"詩経 召南 摽有梅","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"摽有梅，其實七兮。\n求我庶士，迨其吉兮。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_jiangyousi","title_original":"詩經・召南・江有汜","title_ja":"詩経 召南 江有汜","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"江有汜，之子歸，不我以。\n不我以，其後也悔。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_baizhou","title_original":"詩經・邶風・柏舟","title_ja":"詩経 邶風 柏舟","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"汎彼柏舟，亦汎其流。\n耿耿不寐，如有隱憂。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_yanyan","title_original":"詩經・邶風・燕燕","title_ja":"詩経 邶風 燕燕","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"燕燕于飛，差池其羽。\n之子于歸，遠送于野。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_jingnu","title_original":"詩經・邶風・靜女","title_ja":"詩経 邶風 静女","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"靜女其姝，俟我於城隅。\n愛而不見，搔首踟躕。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_shuoren","title_original":"詩經・衛風・碩人","title_ja":"詩経 衛風 碩人","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"碩人其頎，衣錦褧衣。\n齊侯之子，衛侯之妻。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_qiao","title_original":"詩經・衛風・氓","title_ja":"詩経 衛風 氓","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"氓之蚩蚩，抱布貿絲。\n匪來貿絲，來即我謀。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_shuli","title_original":"詩經・王風・黍離","title_ja":"詩経 王風 黍離","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"彼黍離離，彼稷之苗。\n行邁靡靡，中心搖搖。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_shijing_jiangzhongzi","title_original":"詩經・鄭風・將仲子","title_ja":"詩経 鄭風 將仲子","author_name_display":"詩経編者","era_year":-700,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"將仲子兮，無踰我里。\n無折我樹杞，豈敢愛之？","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩經","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuci_jiuge_xiangjun","title_original":"楚辭・九歌・湘君","title_ja":"楚辞 九歌 湘君","author_name_display":"屈原","era_year":-300,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"君不行兮夷猶，蹇誰留兮中洲？\n美要眇兮宜修，沛吾乘兮桂舟。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/楚辭/九歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuci_jiuge_shanggui","title_original":"楚辭・九歌・山鬼","title_ja":"楚辞 九歌 山鬼","author_name_display":"屈原","era_year":-300,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"若有人兮山之阿，被薜荔兮帶女蘿。\n既含睇兮又宜笑，子慕予兮善窈窕。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/楚辭/九歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_chuci_jiuge_guoshang","title_original":"楚辭・九歌・國殤","title_ja":"楚辞 九歌 国殤","author_name_display":"屈原","era_year":-300,"era_period":"先秦","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"操吳戈兮被犀甲，車錯轂兮短兵接。\n旌蔽日兮敵若雲，矢交墜兮士爭先。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/楚辭/九歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_changgexing","title_original":"漢樂府・長歌行","title_ja":"漢楽府 長歌行","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":100,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"青青園中葵，朝露待日晞。\n陽春布德澤，萬物生光輝。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/長歌行","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_jiangnan","title_original":"漢樂府・江南","title_ja":"漢楽府 江南","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":100,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"江南可採蓮，蓮葉何田田。\n魚戲蓮葉間，魚戲蓮葉東。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/江南","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_moshangsang","title_original":"漢樂府・陌上桑","title_ja":"漢楽府 陌上桑","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":100,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"日出東南隅，照我秦氏樓。\n秦氏有好女，自名為羅敷。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/陌上桑","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_shiwu","title_original":"漢樂府・十五從軍征","title_ja":"漢楽府 十五従軍征","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":100,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"十五從軍征，八十始得歸。\n道逢鄉里人，家中有阿誰？","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/十五從軍征","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_kongque","title_original":"漢樂府・孔雀東南飛","title_ja":"漢楽府 孔雀東南飛","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":200,"era_period":"漢末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"孔雀東南飛，五里一徘徊。\n十三能織素，十四學裁衣。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/孔雀東南飛","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuefu_yueye","title_original":"漢樂府・上邪","title_ja":"漢楽府 上邪","author_name_display":"漢樂府","era_year":100,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楽府","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"上邪！我欲與君相知，長命無絕衰。\n山無陵，江水為竭，冬雷震震，夏雨雪。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/上邪","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xiangyu_gaixia","title_original":"項羽・垓下歌","title_ja":"項羽 垓下歌","author_name_display":"項羽","era_year":-202,"era_period":"楚漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞調","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"力拔山兮氣蓋世，時不利兮騅不逝。\n騅不逝兮可奈何，虞兮虞兮奈若何！","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/垓下歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liubang_dafeng","title_original":"劉邦・大風歌","title_ja":"劉邦 大風歌","author_name_display":"劉邦","era_year":-195,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞調","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"大風起兮雲飛揚，威加海內兮歸故鄉，安得猛士兮守四方！","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/大風歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liuche_qiufeng","title_original":"漢武帝・秋風辭","title_ja":"漢武帝 秋風辞","author_name_display":"劉徹（漢武帝）","era_year":-104,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"楚辞調","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"秋風起兮白雲飛，草木黃落兮雁南歸。\n蘭有秀兮菊有芳，懷佳人兮不能忘。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/秋風辭","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_simaxiangru_changmen","title_original":"司馬相如・長門賦","title_ja":"司馬相如 長門賦","author_name_display":"司馬相如","era_year":-130,"era_period":"漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"賦","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"夫何一佳人兮，步逍遙以自虞。\n魂踰佚而不反兮，形枯槁而獨居。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/長門賦","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_zhanghen_sichouxiang","title_original":"張衡・四愁詩","title_ja":"張衡 四愁詩","author_name_display":"張衡","era_year":130,"era_period":"後漢","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"我所思兮在太山，欲往從之梁父艱。\n側身東望涕霑翰，美人贈我金錯刀。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/四愁詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_caocao_guancanghai","title_original":"曹操・觀滄海","title_ja":"曹操 観滄海","author_name_display":"曹操","era_year":207,"era_period":"後漢末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"東臨碣石，以觀滄海。\n水何澹澹，山島竦峙。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/觀滄海","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_caocao_guisuishou","title_original":"曹操・龜雖壽","title_ja":"曹操 亀雖寿","author_name_display":"曹操","era_year":207,"era_period":"後漢末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"四言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"神龜雖壽，猶有竟時。\n螣蛇乘霧，終為土灰。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/龜雖壽","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_caozhi_baima","title_original":"曹植・白馬篇","title_ja":"曹植 白馬篇","author_name_display":"曹植","era_year":220,"era_period":"魏","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"白馬飾金羈，連翩西北馳。\n借問誰家子，幽并遊俠兒。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/白馬篇","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_caozhi_qiai","title_original":"曹植・七哀詩","title_ja":"曹植 七哀詩","author_name_display":"曹植","era_year":225,"era_period":"魏","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"明月照高樓，流光正徘徊。\n上有愁思婦，悲歎有餘哀。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/七哀詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_caozhi_yu","title_original":"曹植・贈白馬王彪","title_ja":"曹植 贈白馬王彪","author_name_display":"曹植","era_year":223,"era_period":"魏","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"謁帝承明廬，逝將歸舊疆。\n清晨發皇邑，日夕過首陽。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/贈白馬王彪","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangcan_qiai","title_original":"王粲・七哀詩","title_ja":"王粲 七哀詩 其一","author_name_display":"王粲","era_year":195,"era_period":"後漢末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"西京亂無象，豺虎方遘患。\n復棄中國去，委身適荊蠻。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/七哀詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ruanji_yonghuai_1","title_original":"阮籍・詠懷詩 其一","title_ja":"阮籍 詠懐詩 其一","author_name_display":"阮籍","era_year":260,"era_period":"魏晋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"夜中不能寐，起坐彈鳴琴。\n薄帷鑑明月，清風吹我襟。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詠懷詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_zuosi_yongshi","title_original":"左思・詠史 其一","title_ja":"左思 詠史 其一","author_name_display":"左思","era_year":270,"era_period":"西晋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"弱冠弄柔翰，卓犖觀群書。\n著論準過秦，作賦擬子虛。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詠史","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_taoyuanming_yinjiu_other","title_original":"陶淵明・飲酒・其七","title_ja":"陶淵明 飲酒 其七","author_name_display":"陶淵明","era_year":410,"era_period":"東晋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"秋菊有佳色，裛露掇其英。\n汎此忘憂物，遠我遺世情。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/飲酒","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xielingyun_dengchi","title_original":"謝靈運・登池上樓","title_ja":"謝霊運 登池上楼","author_name_display":"謝霊運","era_year":423,"era_period":"南朝宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"潛虬媚幽姿，飛鴻響遠音。\n薄霄愧雲浮，棲川怍淵沉。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/登池上樓","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xietiao_wanrengao","title_original":"謝朓・晚登三山還望京邑","title_ja":"謝朓 晩登三山還望京邑","author_name_display":"謝朓","era_year":495,"era_period":"南斉","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"灞涘望長安，河陽視京縣。\n白日麗飛甍，參差皆可見。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/晚登三山還望京邑","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuxin_aijiangnan","title_original":"庾信・哀江南賦","title_ja":"庾信 哀江南賦序","author_name_display":"庾信","era_year":579,"era_period":"北周","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"賦","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"粵以戊辰之年，建亥之月，大盜移國，金陵瓦解。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/哀江南賦","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_le_chile","title_original":"敕勒歌","title_ja":"敕勒歌","author_name_display":"北朝民歌","era_year":550,"era_period":"北朝","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"民歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"敕勒川，陰山下。\n天似穹廬，籠蓋四野。\n天蒼蒼，野茫茫，風吹草低見牛羊。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/敕勒歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_mulan","title_original":"木蘭辭","title_ja":"木蘭辞","author_name_display":"北朝民歌","era_year":580,"era_period":"北朝","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"民歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"唧唧復唧唧，木蘭當戶織。\n不聞機杼聲，惟聞女歎息。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/木蘭辭","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_zixie_shi","title_original":"南朝・子夜歌","title_ja":"南朝 子夜歌","author_name_display":"南朝民歌","era_year":420,"era_period":"南朝","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"民歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"落日出前門，瞻矚見子度。\n冶容多姿鬢，芳香已盈路。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/子夜歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_xizhou_qu","title_original":"南朝・西洲曲","title_ja":"南朝 西洲曲","author_name_display":"南朝民歌","era_year":500,"era_period":"南朝","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"民歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"憶梅下西洲，折梅寄江北。\n單衫杏子紅，雙鬢鴉雛色。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/西洲曲","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangbo_chun","title_original":"王勃・春思","title_ja":"王勃 春思賦","author_name_display":"王勃","era_year":675,"era_period":"初唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"賦","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"憶昔三冬正凄切，浩齒蘭心折寒月。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/春思賦","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_yangjiong_congjun","title_original":"楊炯・從軍行","title_ja":"楊炯 従軍行","author_name_display":"楊炯","era_year":680,"era_period":"初唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"烽火照西京，心中自不平。\n牙璋辭鳳闕，鐵騎繞龍城。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/從軍行_(楊炯)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_zhangjiuling_wangyue","title_original":"張九齡・望月懷遠","title_ja":"張九齢 望月懐遠","author_name_display":"張九齢","era_year":735,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"海上生明月，天涯共此時。\n情人怨遙夜，竟夕起相思。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/望月懷遠","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_hejizhang_huixiang","title_original":"賀知章・回鄉偶書","title_ja":"賀知章 回郷偶書","author_name_display":"賀知章","era_year":744,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"少小離家老大回，鄉音無改鬢毛衰。\n兒童相見不相識，笑問客從何處來。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/回鄉偶書","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangzhihuan_dengguanque","title_original":"王之渙・登鸛雀樓","title_ja":"王之渙 登鸛雀楼","author_name_display":"王之渙","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"白日依山盡，黃河入海流。\n欲窮千里目，更上一層樓。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/登鸛雀樓","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangzhihuan_liangzhou","title_original":"王之渙・涼州詞","title_ja":"王之渙 涼州詞","author_name_display":"王之渙","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"黃河遠上白雲間，一片孤城萬仞山。\n羌笛何須怨楊柳，春風不度玉門關。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/涼州詞","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_menghaoran_chunxiao","title_original":"孟浩然・春曉","title_ja":"孟浩然 春暁","author_name_display":"孟浩然","era_year":730,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"春眠不覺曉，處處聞啼鳥。\n夜來風雨聲，花落知多少。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/春曉","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_menghaoran_suijianglou","title_original":"孟浩然・宿建德江","title_ja":"孟浩然 宿建徳江","author_name_display":"孟浩然","era_year":725,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"移舟泊煙渚，日暮客愁新。\n野曠天低樹，江清月近人。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/宿建德江","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wanghan_liangzhou","title_original":"王翰・涼州詞","title_ja":"王翰 涼州詞","author_name_display":"王翰","era_year":720,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"葡萄美酒夜光杯，欲飲琵琶馬上催。\n醉臥沙場君莫笑，古來征戰幾人回。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/涼州詞_(王翰)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangchangling_chuse","title_original":"王昌齡・出塞","title_ja":"王昌齢 出塞","author_name_display":"王昌齢","era_year":735,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"秦時明月漢時關，萬里長征人未還。\n但使龍城飛將在，不教胡馬度陰山。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/出塞","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangchangling_furong","title_original":"王昌齡・芙蓉樓送辛漸","title_ja":"王昌齢 芙蓉楼送辛漸","author_name_display":"王昌齢","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"寒雨連江夜入吳，平明送客楚山孤。\n洛陽親友如相問，一片冰心在玉壺。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/芙蓉樓送辛漸","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_yueyemu","title_original":"李白・玉階怨","title_ja":"李白 玉階怨","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":745,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"玉階生白露，夜久侵羅襪。\n卻下水晶簾，玲瓏望秋月。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/玉階怨","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_changganxing","title_original":"李白・長干行","title_ja":"李白 長干行","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":730,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"妾髮初覆額，折花門前劇。\n郎騎竹馬來，繞床弄青梅。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/長干行","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_huanghe2","title_original":"李白・送友人","title_ja":"李白 送友人","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":750,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"青山橫北郭，白水繞東城。\n此地一為別，孤蓬萬里征。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/送友人","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_xiaowuye","title_original":"李白・夢遊天姥吟留別","title_ja":"李白 夢遊天姥吟留別","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":745,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"海客談瀛洲，煙濤微茫信難求。\n越人語天姥，雲霞明滅或可睹。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/夢遊天姥吟留別","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_qiupu","title_original":"李白・秋浦歌","title_ja":"李白 秋浦歌 其十五","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":753,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"白髮三千丈，緣愁似個長。\n不知明鏡裡，何處得秋霜。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/秋浦歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_libai_xiazhongnan","title_original":"李白・下終南山","title_ja":"李白 下終南山過斛斯山人宿置酒","author_name_display":"李白","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"暮從碧山下，山月隨人歸。\n卻顧所來徑，蒼蒼橫翠微。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/下終南山","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_chunyexi","title_original":"杜甫・春夜喜雨","title_ja":"杜甫 春夜喜雨","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":761,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"好雨知時節，當春乃發生。\n隨風潛入夜，潤物細無聲。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/春夜喜雨","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_yuesetie","title_original":"杜甫・月夜","title_ja":"杜甫 月夜","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":756,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"今夜鄜州月，閨中只獨看。\n遙憐小兒女，未解憶長安。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/月夜","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_chunyongmaowu","title_original":"杜甫・茅屋為秋風所破歌","title_ja":"杜甫 茅屋為秋風所破歌","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":761,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"八月秋高風怒號，卷我屋上三重茅。\n茅飛渡江灑江郊，高者掛罥長林梢。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/茅屋為秋風所破歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_qiang","title_original":"杜甫・羌村","title_ja":"杜甫 羌村 其三","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":757,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"群雞正亂叫，客至雞鬥爭。\n驅雞上樹木，始聞叩柴荊。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/羌村","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_shiba","title_original":"杜甫・贈衛八處士","title_ja":"杜甫 贈衛八処士","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":759,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"人生不相見，動如參與商。\n今夕復何夕，共此燈燭光。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/贈衛八處士","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_keshi","title_original":"杜甫・客至","title_ja":"杜甫 客至","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":761,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"舍南舍北皆春水，但見群鷗日日來。\n花徑不曾緣客掃，蓬門今始為君開。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/客至","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dufu_wenguanjun","title_original":"杜甫・聞官軍收河南河北","title_ja":"杜甫 聞官軍収河南河北","author_name_display":"杜甫","era_year":763,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"劍外忽傳收薊北，初聞涕淚滿衣裳。\n卻看妻子愁何在，漫卷詩書喜欲狂。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/聞官軍收河南河北","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangwei_shanjuqiu","title_original":"王維・山居秋暝","title_ja":"王維 山居秋暝","author_name_display":"王維","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"空山新雨後，天氣晚來秋。\n明月松間照，清泉石上流。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/山居秋暝","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangwei_jiuyue","title_original":"王維・九月九日憶山東兄弟","title_ja":"王維 九月九日憶山東兄弟","author_name_display":"王維","era_year":717,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"獨在異鄉為異客，每逢佳節倍思親。\n遙知兄弟登高處，遍插茱萸少一人。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/九月九日憶山東兄弟","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangwei_weicheng","title_original":"王維・送元二使安西","title_ja":"王維 送元二使安西（渭城曲）","author_name_display":"王維","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"渭城朝雨浥輕塵，客舍青青柳色新。\n勸君更盡一杯酒，西出陽關無故人。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/送元二使安西","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangwei_zhuli","title_original":"王維・竹里館","title_ja":"王維 竹里館","author_name_display":"王維","era_year":740,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"獨坐幽篁裡，彈琴復長嘯。\n深林人不知，明月來相照。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/竹里館","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_gaoshi_biedongdao","title_original":"高適・別董大","title_ja":"高適 別董大","author_name_display":"高適","era_year":747,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"千里黃雲白日曛，北風吹雁雪紛紛。\n莫愁前路無知己，天下誰人不識君。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/別董大","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_censhen_baiyu","title_original":"岑參・白雪歌送武判官歸京","title_ja":"岑参 白雪歌送武判官帰京","author_name_display":"岑参","era_year":754,"era_period":"盛唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"北風卷地白草折，胡天八月即飛雪。\n忽如一夜春風來，千樹萬樹梨花開。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/白雪歌送武判官歸京","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_baijuyi_youyuan","title_original":"白居易・賦得古原草送別","title_ja":"白居易 賦得古原草送別","author_name_display":"白居易","era_year":788,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"離離原上草，一歲一枯榮。\n野火燒不盡，春風吹又生。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/賦得古原草送別","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_baijuyi_yiyixiang","title_original":"白居易・憶江南","title_ja":"白居易 憶江南","author_name_display":"白居易","era_year":830,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"江南好，風景舊曾諳。\n日出江花紅勝火，春來江水綠如藍。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/憶江南","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuanzhen_lisi","title_original":"元稹・離思 其四","title_ja":"元稹 離思 其四","author_name_display":"元稹","era_year":820,"era_period":"中唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"曾經滄海難為水，除卻巫山不是雲。\n取次花叢懶回顧，半緣修道半緣君。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/離思","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liyu_yumei","title_original":"李煜・虞美人","title_ja":"李煜 虞美人「春花秋月何時了」","author_name_display":"李煜","era_year":978,"era_period":"五代","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"春花秋月何時了，往事知多少。\n小樓昨夜又東風，故國不堪回首月明中。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/虞美人_(春花秋月何時了)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liyu_xiangjianhuan","title_original":"李煜・相見歡","title_ja":"李煜 相見歓「無言獨上西樓」","author_name_display":"李煜","era_year":975,"era_period":"五代","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"無言獨上西樓，月如鉤。\n寂寞梧桐深院鎖清秋。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/相見歡","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wenanjie_pusaman","title_original":"溫庭筠・菩薩蠻","title_ja":"温庭筠 菩薩蛮「小山重疊金明滅」","author_name_display":"温庭筠","era_year":860,"era_period":"晩唐","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"小山重疊金明滅，鬢雲欲度香腮雪。\n懶起畫蛾眉，弄妝梳洗遲。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/菩薩蠻","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_weizhuang_pusaman","title_original":"韋莊・菩薩蠻","title_ja":"韋荘 菩薩蛮「人人盡說江南好」","author_name_display":"韋荘","era_year":900,"era_period":"五代","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"人人盡說江南好，遊人只合江南老。\n春水碧於天，畫船聽雨眠。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/菩薩蠻_(韋莊)","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_fanzhongyan_yujialan","title_original":"范仲淹・漁家傲","title_ja":"范仲淹 漁家傲「塞下秋來風景異」","author_name_display":"范仲淹","era_year":1040,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"塞下秋來風景異，衡陽雁去無留意。\n四面邊聲連角起，千嶂裡，長煙落日孤城閉。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/漁家傲","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yanshu_huanxisha","title_original":"晏殊・浣溪沙","title_ja":"晏殊 浣溪沙「一曲新詞酒一杯」","author_name_display":"晏殊","era_year":1050,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"一曲新詞酒一杯，去年天氣舊亭臺。\n夕陽西下幾時回？\n無可奈何花落去，似曾相識燕歸來。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/浣溪沙","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liuyong_yulin","title_original":"柳永・雨霖鈴","title_ja":"柳永 雨霖鈴「寒蟬淒切」","author_name_display":"柳永","era_year":1030,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"寒蟬淒切，對長亭晚，驟雨初歇。\n都門帳飲無緒，留戀處，蘭舟催發。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/雨霖鈴","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_ouyangxiu_diele","title_original":"歐陽修・蝶戀花","title_ja":"欧陽脩 蝶恋花「庭院深深深幾許」","author_name_display":"欧陽脩","era_year":1050,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"庭院深深深幾許？\n楊柳堆煙，簾幕無重數。\n玉勒雕鞍遊冶處，樓高不見章臺路。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/蝶戀花","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wangani_yuanri","title_original":"王安石・元日","title_ja":"王安石 元日","author_name_display":"王安石","era_year":1070,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"爆竹聲中一歲除，春風送暖入屠蘇。\n千門萬戶曈曈日，總把新桃換舊符。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/元日","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_sushi_dingfengbo","title_original":"蘇軾・定風波","title_ja":"蘇軾 定風波「莫聽穿林打葉聲」","author_name_display":"蘇軾","era_year":1082,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"莫聽穿林打葉聲，何妨吟嘯且徐行。\n竹杖芒鞋輕勝馬，誰怕？\n一蓑煙雨任平生。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/定風波","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_sushi_jiangchengzi","title_original":"蘇軾・江城子","title_ja":"蘇軾 江城子「十年生死兩茫茫」","author_name_display":"蘇軾","era_year":1075,"era_period":"北宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"十年生死兩茫茫，不思量，自難忘。\n千里孤墳，無處話淒涼。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/江城子","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liqingzhao_yi","title_original":"李清照・一剪梅","title_ja":"李清照 一剪梅「紅藕香殘玉簟秋」","author_name_display":"李清照","era_year":1108,"era_period":"北宋末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"紅藕香殘玉簟秋。\n輕解羅裳，獨上蘭舟。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/一剪梅","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_liqingzhao_rumeng","title_original":"李清照・如夢令","title_ja":"李清照 如夢令「常記溪亭日暮」","author_name_display":"李清照","era_year":1100,"era_period":"北宋末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"常記溪亭日暮，沉醉不知歸路。\n興盡晚回舟，誤入藕花深處。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/如夢令","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_lu_you_liu","title_original":"陸游・遊山西村","title_ja":"陸游 遊山西村","author_name_display":"陸游","era_year":1167,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"莫笑農家臘酒渾，豐年留客足雞豚。\n山重水複疑無路，柳暗花明又一村。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/遊山西村","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_lu_you_chai","title_original":"陸游・釵頭鳳","title_ja":"陸游 釵頭鳳「紅酥手」","author_name_display":"陸游","era_year":1155,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"紅酥手，黃縢酒，滿城春色宮牆柳。\n東風惡，歡情薄。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/釵頭鳳","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xinqiji_qingyu","title_original":"辛棄疾・青玉案","title_ja":"辛棄疾 青玉案・元夕","author_name_display":"辛棄疾","era_year":1180,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"東風夜放花千樹，更吹落，星如雨。\n寶馬雕車香滿路。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/青玉案","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_xinqiji_chouhennian","title_original":"辛棄疾・醜奴兒","title_ja":"辛棄疾 醜奴兒「少年不識愁滋味」","author_name_display":"辛棄疾","era_year":1185,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"少年不識愁滋味，愛上層樓。\n愛上層樓，為賦新詞強說愁。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/醜奴兒","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_zhuxi_chunri","title_original":"朱熹・春日","title_ja":"朱熹 春日","author_name_display":"朱熹","era_year":1170,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"勝日尋芳泗水濱，無邊光景一時新。\n等閒識得東風面，萬紫千紅總是春。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/春日","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yangwanli_xiaochi","title_original":"楊萬里・小池","title_ja":"楊万里 小池","author_name_display":"楊万里","era_year":1180,"era_period":"南宋","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"泉眼無聲惜細流，樹陰照水愛晴柔。\n小荷才露尖尖角，早有蜻蜓立上頭。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/小池","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_wenliang_zhengqige","title_original":"文天祥・正氣歌","title_ja":"文天祥 正気歌（冒頭）","author_name_display":"文天祥","era_year":1281,"era_period":"南宋末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言古詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"天地有正氣，雜然賦流形。\n下則為河嶽，上則為日星。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/正氣歌","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_mzhi_yuan_tianjingsha","title_original":"馬致遠・天淨沙・秋思","title_ja":"馬致遠 天浄沙・秋思","author_name_display":"馬致遠","era_year":1295,"era_period":"元","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"散曲","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"枯藤老樹昏鴉，小橋流水人家，古道西風瘦馬。\n夕陽西下，斷腸人在天涯。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/天淨沙","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_guanhanqing_dousha","title_original":"關漢卿・竇娥冤","title_ja":"関漢卿 竇娥冤（曲）","author_name_display":"関漢卿","era_year":1290,"era_period":"元","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"元曲","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"沒來由犯王法，不提防遭刑憲。\n叫聲屈動地驚天。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/竇娥冤","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_gaoqi_meihua","title_original":"高啓・梅花九首・其一","title_ja":"高啓 梅花九首 其一","author_name_display":"高啓","era_year":1370,"era_period":"明初","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"瓊姿只合在瑤臺，誰向江南處處栽。\n雪滿山中高士臥，月明林下美人來。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/梅花九首","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_yuanmei_suoshi","title_original":"袁枚・所見","title_ja":"袁枚 所見","author_name_display":"袁枚","era_year":1750,"era_period":"清","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"五言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"牧童騎黃牛，歌聲振林樾。\n意欲捕鳴蟬，忽然閉口立。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/所見","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_zhengxie_zhushi","title_original":"鄭燮・竹石","title_ja":"鄭燮（板橋） 竹石","author_name_display":"鄭燮","era_year":1750,"era_period":"清","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"咬定青山不放鬆，立根原在破岩中。\n千磨萬擊還堅勁，任爾東西南北風。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/竹石","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_naranxd_changxiang","title_original":"納蘭性德・長相思","title_ja":"納蘭性徳 長相思「山一程」","author_name_display":"納蘭性徳","era_year":1685,"era_period":"清","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"詞","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"山一程，水一程，身向榆關那畔行。\n夜深千帳燈。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/長相思","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_gongzizhen_jihai","title_original":"龔自珍・己亥雜詩・其五","title_ja":"龔自珍 己亥雑詩 其五","author_name_display":"龔自珍","era_year":1839,"era_period":"清末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"浩蕩離愁白日斜，吟鞭東指即天涯。\n落紅不是無情物，化作春泥更護花。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/己亥雜詩","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_qiujin_zashi","title_original":"秋瑾・對酒","title_ja":"秋瑾 対酒","author_name_display":"秋瑾","era_year":1905,"era_period":"清末","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言絶句","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"不惜千金買寶刀，貂裘換酒也堪豪。\n一腔熱血勤珍重，灑去猶能化碧濤。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/對酒","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_huangjingzhang_caiwei","title_original":"黃景仁・雜感","title_ja":"黄景仁 雑感","author_name_display":"黄景仁","era_year":1775,"era_period":"清中期","culture_region":"中国古典","language_original":"lzh","form_genre":"七言律詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"仙佛茫茫兩未成，只知獨夜不平鳴。\n風蓬飄盡悲歌氣，泥絮沾來薄倖名。","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/雜感","source_archive":"維基文庫","canonical_tier":2}
]}
